  "translation": "Gomme ba ema kgahlanong le Uzjahu kgoši, mme ba mo re: Aowa go wena, Uzjahu, go fiša mooko go Yahwe, ka gobane go bamoperisita, bana ba Aharone, bao ba kgethwago, go fiša mooko. Tšwa go sebokgethwa, ka gobane o phodile boikgopolo, gomme aowa go wena go tlotso go tšwa go Yahwe Elohim.",
